Create a striking 9:16 vertical street-sports poster blending photorealistic action photography with experimental architectural typography.

Capture an athlete at the peak of an explosive movement, using a dynamic low-angle wide lens. Maintain accurate body mechanics, realistic equipment, and authentic urban textures.

Transform the environment into a massive typographic canvas. Integrate oversized, heavy sans-serif letters into stairs, curved tunnels, reflective pavement, or circular floors.

Make the typography follow the actual geometry of the scene. Use strong foreshortening, perspective alignment, surface bending, and natural occlusion to create convincing spatial illusions.

Keep the athlete visually prominent while giant letters dominate the foreground. Use bold color blocking, dramatic lighting, and a clear sense of motion.

Add polished editorial typography: brand name, project label, vertical sport details, and a short bottom slogan.

The headline must remain correctly spelled and readable.

High-energy street culture, powerful compositions, premium sports advertising aesthetics. Avoid generic overlays, distorted anatomy, random text, and unnecessary visual clutter.

